    "answer": {
      "short": "$(1-2x)(5x+2)$",
      "worked": "The quadratic term is $(-2x)(5x)=-10x^2$, the cross terms are $5x-4x=x$, and the constant is $2$.\n$$2+x-10x^2=(1-2x)(5x+2).$$",
